{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_ray_set_2_story_1","storyGroup":"story_ray_set_2","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"月下舞者","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"莱伊在罗德岛获得了安稳的生活，心中却仍执着追寻光与驮兽。在向朋友表达心中所想后，她将带上自己的沙地兽再次启程。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_ray_2_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["“巨兽”","莱伊","阿兰娜","热情的后勤干员","疑惑的人事干员","担忧的医疗干员","？？？","小沙地兽","大沙地兽？","大沙地兽","着急的干员","慌张的干员","热心的干员","通讯器里的声音","严谨的干员","温米"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"charslot","id":4},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":5,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":6},{"type":"dialog","id":7},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_46_i03.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":8},{"type":"dialog","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"6","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":14},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":16},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"charslot","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“巨兽”","text":"算了，小家伙，俺虽然不能挪动身体，但也不是完全动弹不得。","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“巨兽”","text":"既然你难得跑到这里来，俺还有一个小问题。","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“巨兽”","text":"就当俺是那个“巨兽”，就是你要找的那束光吧——","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“巨兽”","text":"你跑了这么远，是希望俺帮你做什么呢？","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"我......","id":24},{"type":"dialog","id":25},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":26},{"type":"image","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"5","id":28},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_bg_bg_canteen.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":31,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","duration":"2","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"你好，请问......你们有看到莱伊吗？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_972_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的后勤干员","text":"莱伊小姐？我刚才看见她了！","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_972_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_972_1#1$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的后勤干员","text":"我刚给她打好饭菜，她就一边端着饭盒吃饭一边走了......","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_972_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_972_1#1$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热情的后勤干员","text":"当时她好像在追着一个毛茸茸的影子，应该是她的沙地兽吧？","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_972_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"谢谢！麻烦你了！","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":45},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":46},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":48},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesupperdeck.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"请问......呼......呼......请问你见过莱伊吗？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_090","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的人事干员","text":"我今天倒是见到了她好几次......我正奇怪呢。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_090.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_090","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的人事干员","text":"我上午坐班的时候，看见她出现在那个拐角好多次，而且走路的速度越来越快。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_090.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_090","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疑惑的人事干员","text":"这么说来，阿兰娜你好像也出现了很多次......","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_090.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"因......因为我在找她！","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"charslot","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":65},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"呼......呼......呼......","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_088","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的医疗干员","text":"阿、阿兰娜小姐......请问你还好吗？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_npc_088.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"没、没事......","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"喂。","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#8$1","id":76},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"哇——？！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#4$1","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"怎么了？我刚才听整条船的人说你在找我，所以我过来了。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#6$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"是啊......我找你找了一整个上午，几乎都要把这艘船翻过来了！","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......抱歉，我一直在遛沙地兽。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_1188_1#3$1","focus":"M","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小沙地兽","text":"（虚弱地瘫倒）","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"......","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"是不是我的错觉......这只沙地兽是不是大了一圈？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_1188_1#3$1","focus":"M","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大沙地兽？","text":"嗷？","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"前段时间活有点多，拜托后勤部的同事帮忙喂了几天。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"结果回来的时候，沙地兽就变成球了。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#4$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"呃......","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"所以，我现在一有空就带它出来散步。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":106},{"type":"text","text":"莱伊突然像是想起了什么，在自己的上衣口袋里翻找起来。","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"这个月的分期......不够。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"这是我的饭卡，你先拿去，就当......利息。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#3$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"你怎么还在惦记这事，我不是为了讨债来的......我就是好久没在内部论坛看到你的“轶事”了，想亲自过来看看你的近况。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"嗯，最近没有安全违规，也不需要签保证书。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"那就好。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"（长舒一口气）","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#8$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"怎么了？","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"早知道不是讨债，就不躲着你了。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#6$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"莱伊，你不是一直在遛沙地兽吗——？！","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"因为我一直想不出借口。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#7$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"你——？！","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"charslot","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":134},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_bg_bg_room_2.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#7$1","id":137},{"type":"multiline","name":"阿兰娜","text":"你——这——","id":138},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"10","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":139},{"type":"multiline","name":"阿兰娜","text":"宿舍——一点——","id":140},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"30","randomness":"10","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":141},{"type":"multiline","name":"阿兰娜","end":"true","text":"地方——都没有啊！","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_1188_1#3$1","focus":"M","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大沙地兽","text":"嗷——！","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"charslot","id":146},{"type":"text","text":"两人一兽从沙箱和门之间仅有的缝隙穿过，终于在床边有了一丝落脚的地方。","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"这个沙箱什么时候又变大了一号......也是难为你每天这样进进出出了。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"嗷嗷需要更大的空间，我只需要睡觉的地方。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"text","text":"两人并排坐在床边，一起看着沙地兽在沙箱里大口喝水。","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#3$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"......","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#3$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"我记得它之前一直都躲在那个石头的角落里......没想到它现在已经不怕我了。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"这里的人，不凶。上次嗷嗷撞坏靶子，杜宾教官没骂，最后是我们一起修好的。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"那就好，看见你的生活一点点步入正轨，我就放心了。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"你知道吗，我现在每天在工程部帮忙调试新设备。虽然忙，但比在矿井里的时候好上千倍。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"不用再担心塌方，不用再喝带着泥沙的水，每天都能吃到热乎的饭菜，晚上还能躺在干净的床上睡觉。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"这种安稳的日子，以前在矿井里的时候，我连做梦都不敢想。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"嗯，罗德岛安稳，安全，什么都有。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#4$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"讲真，我一开始挺担心你会不会不适应这里的生活。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"但刚才找你的时候，我看着大家现在都认识你，甚至你们相处还挺融洽，我就彻底不担心了。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"所以啊，你也别总想着还钱了。现在生活稳定下来了，你可以好好筹划一下以后的日子。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"给沙地兽弄好窝以后，也给自己添点东西，不要像现在这样节俭......","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"charslot","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"就在阿兰娜环视莱伊的宿舍时，她注意到天花板上有一幅海报。","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"这是......“拓荒”？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"哥伦比亚的旧海报。上次出任务，我从街边小贩那收来的。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"text","text":"海报上印着一片荒芜的大地，而在夜空中，闪烁着无数的星星。","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"我还借了哥伦比亚的纪录片，里面说哥伦比亚的荒原和雷姆必拓的很不一样，地面上有奇怪的图案，天上还飞着各种不同形状的铁块。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"如果是那样的话，有会跳舞的驮兽也很合理。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"莱伊伸出了一根手指，指向那海报上的月光，顺着月光的方向，一直到更高处。","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"我准备先把欠你的钱还完，然后就开始攒钱。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"等攒够钱，就租一辆载具，去哥伦比亚的荒原里找那些驮兽。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#4$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"......莱伊，你还在想着那群会跳舞的驮兽？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"嗯，还有那束光。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#3$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"可是，到底为什么呢？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#3$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"你要去找那些不一定存在的驮兽，就会失去现在安稳的生活。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......我不知道。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"可那束光，见过一次后，就再也忘不掉了。就像沙地兽在沙漠里永远都要找水。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#4$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"但这里不是沙漠了，沙地兽随时随地都能喝到水。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#4$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"这里已经没有深不见底的矿井，罗德岛的任何一个地方都要比矿井亮堂。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#4$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"莱伊，难道你不喜欢这里吗？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"不......我很喜欢这里，这里比我之前待过的任何一个地方都要好。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"是啊，你的沙地兽也很喜欢这里吧——","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#8$1","id":222},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"等等，你的沙地兽呢？刚才还在那的......","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"它喝完水，应该是出去了......","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"我刚刚把门关上了啊......","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"——！","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"沙箱的开口正对着窗户，而此刻窗户正半敞开着。","id":233},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":235},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":238},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_bg_bg_rhodesupperdeck.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":241,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"着急的干员","text":"你们有看见莱伊小姐的沙地兽吗？！","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的干员","text":"没有啊，它平时不都是跟着莱伊小姐......怎、怎么了，走丢了吗？","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的干员","text":"赶紧帮忙找找吧！","id":246},{"type":"dialog","id":247},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"监控有死角，没法知道它还在不在船上......","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"我去借一辆载具，回头去追！","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"不行！从它跑丢到现在的时间里，罗德岛已经开出去很远了！","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"不，我必须要找到它......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"charslot","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯器里的声音","text":"阿兰娜小姐，阿兰娜小姐！有干员反映甲板吊桥上好像吊着什么东西。","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"通讯器里的声音","text":"我看你离那边很近，可以拜托你去检修一下吗？","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"甲板吊桥......","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#7$1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"好、好的！","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":270},{"type":"charslot","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":272},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_bg_49_g14_rhodesdeck_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":273},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"呃......唔！","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"你......你，你过来点！","id":276},{"type":"dialog","id":277},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":278},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","volume":"0.6","id":279},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","duration":"1","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"呼，呼......累死我了......","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"我的天，它居然能跑到这么高的地方来，胖成这样居然还这么能爬......","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":287,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_1188_1#3$1","focus":"M","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大沙地兽","text":"（害怕的叫声）嗷......！","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"沙地兽扑到了莱伊的怀里，用自己的绒毛在莱伊手上蹭来蹭去。","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"真是服了它了，罗德岛这么大，它怎么偏偏喜欢往这种高地方跑。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"而且明明是我把它救下来的啊，怎么光顾着黏你了？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"唉，我先去报告情况了。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":299},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"不准蹭我，嗷嗷。做错事了就要受罚。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"莱伊抓住了沙地兽的两只爪子，将它们高举过沙地兽的头顶。","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_1188_1#3$1","focus":"M","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大沙地兽","text":"（抗议的叫声）嗷！","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"快说，你为什么要跑到那么危险的地方？","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_1188_1#3$1","focus":"M","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大沙地兽","text":"（激动的叫声）嗷——","id":312},{"type":"dialog","id":313},{"type":"charslot","id":314},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.5","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":318},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#8$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"哇，怎么突然就开始打雷了？！","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#8$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"怎么了，莱伊？","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......嗷嗷突然跑到高处，是有原因的。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"嗯？","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"沙地兽在荒漠里爬沙丘，有时会站在高处，查看天敌，感知风向。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"有坏天气的时候，沙地兽也是最先感知到的，所以嗷嗷才会跑出来。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"即使罗德岛有遮雨的屋顶，也没有天敌，它还是会这么做。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#4$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"可我之前听说，经过精心养护，沙地兽其实可以在室内长期生活，不用再回到荒漠里去......","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"能养，可它总是想要回到那里，吹吹荒野的风。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_1188_1#3$1","focus":"M","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大沙地兽","text":"（精神的叫声）嗷！","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#4$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"我知道了......莱伊，你还想念着荒野的日子，对吧？","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......你懂？","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"我当然不懂啦！我哪知道那束光对你来说到底意味着什么，还有你一直念叨的那群驮兽。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#3$1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"......但我知道那种心里有个念想的感觉。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#3$1","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"就像我现在虽然在工程部做得很好，但还是会偶尔想起以前当司机时看到的那些美丽的风景。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"既然想去，那就去吧。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......谢谢你，兰娜。","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"不管是为了嗷嗷，还是为了我，谢谢你。","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_1188_1#3$1","focus":"M","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大沙地兽","text":"（开心的叫声）嗷！","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#6$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"莱伊，我还有一个问题——","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.5","id":363},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"豆大的雨点自空中落下，荒漠迎来了今年的第一场太阳雨。","id":367},{"type":"dialog","id":368},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":369},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"charslot","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":373},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_bg_bg_rhodescom.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":376,"musicid":4},{"type":"text","text":"数月后","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_090","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严谨的干员","text":"莱伊干员，哥伦比亚的这个任务区域比较偏僻，补给点很少。","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_090","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严谨的干员","text":"而且据说最近那一带出现了不明原因的源石能量波动，有一定的风险。","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"嗯。我对荒漠很熟悉，沙地兽对气流和温度很敏感，也能帮忙。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_090","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严谨的干员","text":"我知道你的能力很出色，之前参与的几次荒漠救援任务表现都很好。","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_090","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严谨的干员","text":"但还是要提醒你，这次任务的周期比较长，至少要一个月，而且通讯可能会不太稳定。","id":387},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"了解，按照任务规范来做。通讯断了，按路线走，去补给点等。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_090","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严谨的干员","text":"嗯，莱伊干员，祝你一切顺利。","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_090","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严谨的干员","text":"哦，对了！","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"嗯？还有什么事？","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_090","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严谨的干员","text":"感谢你主动承接这个任务，说真的，帮了大忙了。","id":397},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......小事。","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"charslot","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":404},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_bg_corridor.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#9$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"呼，还好赶上了。我打听到你今天要出任务了，就赶紧给你的沙地兽买了一点储备粮。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_NPC_1188_1#3$1","focus":"M","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大沙地兽","text":"（开心的叫声）嗷！","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"哎，你不要谁给你吃的就蹭谁啦！","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"charslot","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"莱伊姐——！","id":415},{"type":"dialog","id":416},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":417},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"AVG_4081_WARMY_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":418},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......小锅盖？","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"她听我说你要出远门了，非要请假过来送送你。","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"你说你也不挑个好时间出发，现在食堂里一堆人等着小锅盖做的晚饭呢。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_4081_WARMY_1#4$2","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"莱伊姐，这个是我准备的便当。听说你后面的任务很辛苦，所以我给的分量比平时多了点！","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"嗯，谢谢你，我会全部吃掉的。","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"那我，走了。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#9$1","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"一路顺风，别忘了回家。","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"会回的。欠你的钱，到时候连本带利还。","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#5$1","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"我都说了不用还啦——！","id":437,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"噗......","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":442},{"type":"charslot","id":443},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":444},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_bg_49_g14_rhodesdeck_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":445},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":446},{"type":"text","text":"夕阳下，阿兰娜和温米站在甲板的护栏边，看着莱伊的载具渐行渐远。","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_4081_WARMY_1#10$2","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"兰娜姐，莱伊姐是去找那束光和那群会跳舞的驮兽了吗？","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_4081_WARMY_1#10$2","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"以前刚来罗德岛的时候，她总和我讲它们的故事，我当初还以为是她特意用来哄我的呢。","id":451},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"她当然是自己相信啦，毕竟她可不是会哄人的人。","id":453,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"M","name":"AVG_4081_WARMY_1#1$2","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温米","text":"真期待莱伊姐回来讲她的新故事呀。","id":455},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#1$1","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"嗯，我们等她回来，听她讲她见到的故事。","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":458},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":459},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":460},{"type":"charslot","id":461},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":462},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":463},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_bg_49_g14_rhodesdeck_d.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":464},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":465},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainheavy_loop","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"river","fadetime":"1","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#8$1","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"（大声）不过我还有一个问题——","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#8$1","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"（大声）有没有一种可能，也许你已经找到了那束光呢？","id":470,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......","id":472,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4178_alanna_1#8$1","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿兰娜","text":"（大声）也许在你的生命中，你已经又见过了那束光，只是你记不清了，所以才意识不到！","id":474,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_4178_alanna_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"......","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"（更大声）光是追寻本身——已经很有趣了！","id":478,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":479},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"river","fadetime":"2","id":480},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":481},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":482},{"type":"charslot","id":483},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":484},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":485},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_bg_bg_0_rhodes3.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":486},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":487},{"type":"text","text":"莱伊有点恍惚。","id":488},{"type":"text","text":"她回头看向那艘渐行渐远的陆行舰，记忆仿佛回到了多年前的某个时刻。","id":489},{"type":"text","text":"那个她被拯救的日子，一个像山一样巨大的影子，在雾中会散发光线。","id":490},{"type":"text","text":"而现在，在那巨大的舰艇上，在一层层晚霞之中的，是她的朋友们。","id":491},{"type":"text","text":"那是她要离开的地方，是她将回来的地方。","id":492},{"type":"dialog","id":493},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":494},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":495},{"type":"charslot","id":496},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":497},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_m.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":498},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大沙地兽","text":"（自由的叫声）嗷！","id":500},{"type":"text","text":"沙地兽的叫声将莱伊的思绪拉回现实，她重新将目光聚焦在前行的道路上。","id":501},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"不急，嗷嗷。慢慢走，慢慢找。","id":503,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4117_ray_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱伊","text":"找不到也没关系，只要在追就好。","id":505,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8c/Avg_avg_4117_ray_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":506},{"type":"charslot","id":507},{"type":"text","text":"莱伊开着载具，越过了沙丘，往荒原深处驶去。","id":508},{"type":"text","text":"身后的夕阳渐渐落下，而身前的月亮逐渐升起。看着月光，她想起了许多。","id":509},{"type":"text","text":"她想起了那群迎着月光舞蹈的驮兽，她想起了站在高处远眺的嗷嗷。","id":510},{"type":"text","text":"她想起了一直在追寻的自己。","id":511},{"type":"dialog","id":512},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":513},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":514},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":515},{"type":"character","id":516},{"type":"image","id":517}],"characters":["“巨兽”","莱伊","阿兰娜","热情的后勤干员","疑惑的人事干员","担忧的医疗干员","？？？","小沙地兽","大沙地兽？","大沙地兽","着急的干员","慌张的干员","热心的干员","通讯器里的声音","严谨的干员","温米"]}